        "text": "<thinking> To extract plain text from a scanned document image, I need to use a concrete external provider. Amazon Textract is a suitable service for this task, as it can extract text from various document types. I will create the file `extract_text.py` with the necessary code to use Amazon Textract for text extraction. </thinking>\n",
